<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Banco Safra first half net rises.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Banco Safra first half net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian private bank Banco Safra S.A. reported the following consolidated first-half 1997 financial results.</p>
<p>			 1997			1996</p>
<p>Shr		  0.18 reais		0.10 reais</p>
<p>Net		  80.7 million	    48 million</p>
<p>Oper Net	   97.3 million	    80.9 million</p>
<p>Pre-tax Profit   99.6 million	    81.2 million</p>
<p>Net Worth	  810.0 million	   670.2 million</p>
<p>Note: Figures are in Brazilian reais and are not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>((--James Craig, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
</text>
